056 - The Day Thou Gavest
 / 
Key: G
Time: 4/4
Tempo: Moderato
Number: 56
Topic: Worship - 

Verse 1:
[D]The [G]day Thou gavest, [D7]Lord, [Em]is [Am]ended, [D7]The [Em]darkness [D/F#]falls [Em]at Thy [Am]behest;
[D/F#]To [G]Thee our [D]morning [D7]hymns [Am]ascended, [D7/C]Thy [Bm]praise shall [Em]hallow [Am/C]now our [D7]rest.

Verse 2:
[D]We [G]thank [D]Thee [Em]that [Am/C]Thy [D7]church, [D/F#]unsleeping
[D]while earth [Em]rolls [Am/C]onward [D/F#]into [Am]light,
[D/F#]through [G]all [D]the [Em]world [D7]her watch is [Bm]keeping,
[D/F#]and [G]rests [D]not [Am]now [D7]by [Bm]day or [Am]night.

Verse 3:
[D]As [G]o'er [D]each [Em]continent [D/F#]and [Em]island
[D]the [G]dawn [D]leads [Em]on [D7]another [Am]day,
[D/F#]the [G]voice [D]of [Em]prayer [D7]is never [Bm]silent,
[D/F#]nor [G]die [D]the [Am]strains [D7]of [Bm]praise away.

Verse 4:
[D]So [G]be [D]it, [Em]Lord; [Am/C]Thy [D7]throne [D/F#]shall [Em]never,
[D]like [G]earth's [D]proud [Em]empires, [D/F#]pass [Em]away.
[D/F#]Thy [G]kingdom [Em]stands, [D7]and grows forever,
[D/F#]till [G]all [D]Thy [Em]creatures [D7]own [Bm]Thy [Am]sway.
